          <h2 class="h2 reveal d1">Five stages. <em>One of them borrowed.</em></h2>
          <p class="sub reveal d2">
            Forge, Cloudflare's Apache-2.0 engine, parses the spec. Ferrule reads the config, keeps one
            language-neutral model, and a plugin per language writes the SDK. The same inputs always write the same
            files.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pipe reveal">
          <div class="io">
            <div>
              <b>In</b><span class="chip">openapi.yml</span><span class="chip">stainless.yml</span><span class="chip"
                >your hand edits</span
              ><span class="chip">last release</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <b>Out</b><span class="chip">an SDK per language</span><span class="chip">api.md</span><span class="chip"
                >.stats.yml</span
              ><span class="chip">ferrule.lock</span><span class="chip">verify report</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stages" id="stages">
            <div class="track"><i></i></div>
            <div class="st on">
              <div class="dot">01</div>
              <h4>Convert</h4>
              <p>Validate stainless.yml against the public schema, apply editions and transforms, annotate the spec.</p>
              <div class="own">converter · Rust</div>
            </div>
            <div class="st forge">
              <div class="dot">02</div>
              <h4>Forge</h4>
              <p>A pinned Forge commit, built into the binary, parses the spec and runs the language plugin in process.</p>
              <div class="own">dependency</div>
            </div>
            <div class="st">
              <div class="dot">03</div>
              <h4>Emit</h4>
              <p>An adapter maps Forge data into one language-neutral model; a plugin per language writes every file.</p>
              <div class="own">sdk-model + plugins · Rust</div>
            </div>
            <div class="st">
              <div class="dot">04</div>
              <h4>Finish</h4>
              <p>Copy the runtime from your repo, format it (ruff for Python), re-apply your custom code.</p>
              <div class="own">migrate · Python</div>
            </div>
            <div class="st">
              <div class="dot">05</div>
              <h4>Verify</h4>
              <p>Diff the public API against a previous release and give a semver verdict.</p>
              <div class="own">migrate · Python</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
